Notice of modification (Apache License 2.0, section 4(b))
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

This project modifies the upstream work substantially. In particular it:

  * restructures a single-file application into separate core, provider and
    user-interface source files under Sources/;
  * replaces the one-credential-per-provider model with first-class accounts,
    so several accounts on the same provider can be monitored at once;
  * adds per-account credential sources, reset schedules, notification
    thresholds, error isolation and stale-data handling;
  * renames the application from "AI Usage Monitor" to
    "Multi AI Usage Monitor" and changes its bundle identifier;
  * adds a test suite, documentation and continuous integration.

Portions of the credential reading, token refresh, response parsing and
progress-bar drawing derive from the upstream project and remain the copyright
of its author.

